# Kalingalinga GIS + ML Automated Valuation Model

This repository implements a GIS and machine learning-based Automated Valuation Model (AVM) for property tax assessment in Lusaka, with a Kalingalinga valuation-gap workflow.

## What this system does

- Loads property valuation records for Kalingalinga
- Loads spatial building footprints for the area
- Identifies buildings that are not represented in the valuation roll
- Detects and reports missing or unrecorded properties
- Trains a Gradient Boosting regressor to predict property values
- Provides a dashboard and API for predictions

## Key result

The system is designed so that in Kalingalinga, the total mapped properties can be greater than the 12 recorded valuation records. This is the valuation-gap detection logic the study requires.

