## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Train the model

```bash
python scripts/train_model.py
```

## Run the dashboard

```bash
streamlit run dashboard.py
```

## Run the API

```bash
uvicorn backend.api:app --reload
```

## Kalingalinga scenario

The sample data is designed to mimic Kalingalinga with:
- 12 recorded valuation properties
- 19 mapped buildings in the study area
- 7 missing/unmatched properties found through spatial comparison

This means the system can report more than 12 properties in Kalingalinga after gap analysis.

## Evaluation metrics

The model reports:
- RMSE
- MAE
- MAPE
- R²

## Notes

This is a practical prototype for a thesis project. For live deployment, replace the sample data with actual council valuation roll data and building footprints.
